## 5.2 Intelligence Tradecraft (`../intelligence/`)

Architecture describes *how A01 is built*. Tradecraft describes *how A01
thinks* — the analytical rules governing what it may claim and on what
evidence. These documents are **normative**: code that contradicts them is a
defect.

| # | Document | Answers |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 22 | `attribution-doctrine.md` | What may A01 claim about who someone is? |
| 23 | `evidence-standard.md` | What counts as proof, and how is it recorded? |
| 24 | `detection-catalog.md` | How does each detection actually work? |
| 25 | `threat-model.md` | Who attacks A01, and how? |
| 26 | `future-problems.md` | What breaks next, and what do we do now? |

Start at [`../intelligence/README.md`](../intelligence/README.md).

